{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an application software for 3D desktop pets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It supports importing\u00a0 most 3D format models, such as (VRM/FBX/OBJ/glTF2, etc.).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, users can only upload VRM files to support various basic actions, motion capture and cloning movements from uploaded videos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It supports desktop special effects, such as the effects of rain, fireworks, mouse trails and so on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disclaimer: Some of the models demonstrated can be downloaded from the Creative Workshop. The application does not come with the models demonstrated directly.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"ModelCountG3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3404940/83cc2f36fcf8f130e0e9166a974729ff8841cd0b.jpg"},{"name":"ActionCountG3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3404940/4a0e88f1c2b9c06f5c515c448a10bc483c99da8a.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3404940?t=1759232268","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404940/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759232268","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404940/7a111639db77b09a42044ecccf7d092467b99d19/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759232268","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404940/7a111639db77b09a42044ecccf7d092467b99d19/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759232268","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an application software for 3D desktop pets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\